OL,3,GNEWSAHouse of Keys election candidates
OL,4,Ato be confirmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FCandidates who will be standing in next
OL,7,Fmonth's general election on the Isle of
OL,8,FMan will be confirmed later.
OL,10,FVoters on the island will have the
OL,11,Fchance on 24 September to elect their
OL,12,Frepresentatives in the Manx parliament
OL,13,Ffor the next five years.
OL,15,FContests look set to take place in each
OL,16,Fof the 12 constituencies that make up
OL,17,Fthe House of Keys.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
