OL,5,
OL,6,FNotices of poll - which will formally
OL,7,Fconfirm the candidates - will be issued
OL,8,Fby the deputy returning officer for
OL,9,Feach area following the end of the
OL,10,Fnomination, objection and withdrawal
OL,11,Fperiods.
